:"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Steps to reproduce\r\nRelated to #2069 , but this is about class variable annotations introduced with [PEP 526](https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0526/)/Python3.6.\r\n\r\n```python\r\n# cat example.py\r\nfrom __future__ import annotations\r\n\r\nclass Example:\r\n    obj: Other\r\n\r\nclass Other:\r\n    ...\r\n```\r\nPylint is sad:\r\n```\r\n$ pylint example.py\r\n************* Module example\r\nexample.py:4:9: E0601: Using variable 'Other' before assignment (used-before-assignment)\r\n```\r\nMypy is fine:\r\n```\r\n$ mypy example.py\r\n$\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Current behavior\r\n\r\nWarns about use-before-assignment, even in the presence of `from __future__ import annotations`\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nNo error.\r\n\r\n### pylint --version output\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ pylint --version\r\npylint 2.4.0-dev0\r\nastroid 2.2.5\r\nPython 3.7.2 (default, Feb  4 2019, 16:07:25)\r\n[Clang 10.0.0 (clang-1000.11.45.5)]\r\n\r\n$ git lg -1\r\n* 75a04791 - (HEAD -> master, origin/master, origin/HEAD) ...\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"PCManticore","id":448166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODE2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore","html_url":"https://github.com/PCManticore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCMa